{"id":"08163b61fc3df1a5","group":"58","path":"58/batch19/58-df-easton.md","title":"Easton's Function","display":"df-easton — Easton's Function","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-easton","aliases":["58-df-easton"],"display":"df-easton — Easton's Function","depends_on":["[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","[[58-df-cofinality]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-easton"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-easton</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-easton — Easton's Function"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"58-df-regular-cardinal\">58-df-regular-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"315ad00b8744fdfc\" href=\"?note=315ad00b8744fdfc\" title=\"58-df-cofinality\">58-df-cofinality</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p>Explicit relation signatures used below: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\">\\(\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^{2}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\">\\(\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in V\">\\(D\\in V\\)</span> (set of regular cardinals)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in V\">\\(F\\in V\\)</span> (candidate set function)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D\\)</span></p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))\">\\(\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))\\)</span> (cofinality of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F(\\kappa)\">\\(F(\\kappa)\\)</span>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span> (regular-cardinal predicate)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (Easton-function predicate)</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}easton} \\vdash \\mathrm{Easton}_S(F,D)\\leftrightarrow D\\in V\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa)))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}easton} \\vdash \\mathrm{Easton}_S(F,D)\\leftrightarrow D\\in V\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;(\\kappa&lt;\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa)))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The set-sized predicate avoids treating a ZFC set function as though its domain were the proper class of all regular cardinals.</li>\n<li>Easton's theorem gives a relative-consistency realization of suitable class Easton functions as the continuum function on regular cardinals; it is not an unconditional equality in the ground model.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-regular-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"0fbfc19800246e77","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-regular-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cofinality","status":"resolved","id":"315ad00b8744fdfc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cofinality]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^{2}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Function}\\subseteq V^{3}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\subseteq V^{1}","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa))","display":false},{"tex":"F(\\kappa)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Easton}_S\\subseteq V^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}easton} \\vdash \\mathrm{Easton}_S(F,D)\\leftrightarrow D\\in V\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(F,D,\\operatorname{ran}(F))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(F(\\kappa))\\land\\forall\\kappa,\\lambda\\in D\\;(\\kappa<\\lambda\\to F(\\kappa)\\leq F(\\lambda))\\land\\forall\\kappa\\in D\\;(\\kappa<\\mathrm{cf}(F(\\kappa)))","display":true}],"bytes":1603,"backlinks":[{"id":"96be027f863914f6","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$F$ (set-sized Easton function on $D$, see [[../batch19/58-df-easton.md]])"},{"id":"ec24beaa6ab5cdfe","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-461","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-easton.md|58-df-easton]]（batch19）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","5fb1c2241d1943d1","0fbfc19800246e77","315ad00b8744fdfc"]}